  "2026-08-01T18:19:16.624Z","harness:codex","Manual compiled-SDK acceptance in an isolated git workspace passed: init, meet, remind, mutation events, named workspace snapshot/list, and merge-install dry-run. Packed consumers installed independently with npm and Bun resolved their own dist/cli.js, accepted leading pm/pm-cli tokens, and rejected an unknown leading token with exit 2."
